              "value": "\n## \ud83d\udcac Facebook Messenger Setup & Token Guide\n\n### Step 1: Get Page Access Token\n1. Go to [Meta Graph API Explorer](https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/).\n2. Under **Meta App**, select your App.\n3. Under **User or Page**, select **Get Page Access Token** and pick your Facebook Page.\n4. Under **Permissions**, add `pages_messaging` and `pages_show_list`.\n5. Click **Generate Access Token** and copy the token into the **Page Access Token** field below.\n\n### Step 2: Set Meta Webhook Callback URL\n1. Copy the Webhook URL from the top of this node (`https://core.aimicromind.com/webhook/{chatflowId}/messenger`).\n2. In Meta Developer Portal \u2794 **Messenger** \u2794 **Webhooks** \u2794 click **Add Callback URL**.\n3. Paste the Webhook URL and enter your **Verify Token** (e.g. `my_messenger_token`).\n4. Click **Verify and Save** \u2705.\n5. Subscribe to `messages` and `messaging_postbacks`.\n\n### Step 3: Activate & Test Live\n1. Toggle the workflow to **ACTIVE** in the canvas header!\n2. Send a Facebook message to your page \u2014 AI will auto-reply in real-time!\n"
